-- Motion presets: entrances (popping, rising, zooming), exits in place, and motion that keeps going.
create a video called presets, 1080 by 1080, on #14121a, 5 s long.
make a card called badge from cardstock, 240 by 240, at 250 300.
make a card called wheel from cardstock, 240 by 240, at 540 300.
make a card called tag from cardstock, 240 by 240, at 830 300.
make a card called banner from cardstock, 820 by 240, at 540 760.
on the badge.
enamel the card in a radial gradient from #fff6c9 to #ff7a3d.
on the wheel.
enamel the card in a gradient from #5ad1c9 to #8f7bff, angled 45.
on the tag.
enamel the card in #ff5d8f.
on the banner.
enamel the card in a gradient from #3a1c71 to #d76d77 to #ffaf7b, angled 0.
bring in the badge at 0.2 s, popping.
bring in the wheel at 0.5 s, rising.
bring in the tag at 0.8 s, zooming.
bring in the banner at 1.1 s, fading.
float the badge, 16 high, every 2 s.
turn the wheel, every 3 s.
sway the tag, 8 degrees, every 1.5 s.
pulse the banner, by 0.04, every 1.2 s.
remove the banner at 4.3 s, shrinking.
